window.RVE=window.RVE||{};window.RVE["com.magoosh.gre.quiz.vocabulary"]=[[5,"I really loved this App. I've been using this since I was preparing for a college entrance exam back 2018. This is really helpful and highly recommended especially for those who want to develop their vocabulary skills. There are awesome features such as: meaning of the word, sample sentence so you can understand more the word usage, and it also has a recorded voice for you to learn the right pronunciation of the word. You can also monitor your progress and how many words you mastered. I made this as a daily habit and I am enjoying so far! But there are some delays of the voice record for pronunciation. Based from my experience, though I clicked on the icon for so many times it kept on loading and did not play until I skip onto the next words and the voice record overlapped. I hope this will be fixed and be further improved. Overall, this is really a helpful app! Thank you so much!","2020-07",388,"+effect,+fun,+listen,+exam,+habit,+wish"],[5,"Just one suggestion. Introduce a feature where we can review the last viewed word by swiping right or something. The synonym options not just lets you learn two words at a time, but also makes you the context. Also, this lets you navigate between the options, and you can analyse why other options aren't correct. Also, the online game makes it competitive and fun. The organization of levels is good as well. I personally prefer learning through a game like this, instead of flashcards or a book.","2019-07",332,"+review,+fun"],[4,"The app has bad ratings 2-4 years ago so it's come a long way since then. But despite being the recommended app on many sites related to vocabulary preparations its got problems. There are some words that can have multiple meanings and it's annoying when it says, \"commit means doing something bad\". It has many more interpretations! When I got that wrong i was like seriously?? There are quite a few words like that. If you want I can try to send some of them from my side. They are misleading.","2022-06",327,""],[5,"Good one! The number of words increase with each level and if you give a wrong answer to a word, the question is repeated randomly to make you aware of the correct meaning. The examples sentences help in understanding the application of a word in a sentence. And the same set of words are given whenever you attempt a level, so it's easy to go back to any word you have learnt through the app.","2020-08",222,"+short,+exam"],[5,"Absolutely love it. One addition I would like to see is an option to see a rundown list of all the words you have done in a particular section (e.g SAT words, beginner, level 1). Sometimes I see a word very similar to one I had just previously done in some section, and I would like to go back and see the spelling so I can properly learn to differentiate between the two but going through 60 words or more, for one, is a huge hassle.","2021-08",181,"+exam"],[5,"Excellent app with a clean user interface, well manoeuvred practice sessions, and most significantly with the provision of engaging gaming experience to master every word. Once you are into it, you can't come out of the loop without improving your vocabulary! Kudos to the team for developing such a useful as well as fun app. Above all, it's absolutely ad-free and device independent. You can carry forward your ongoing lessons and games to other devices with the syncing option. Highly recommended!","2022-01",163,"+effect,+fun,+free"],[5,"It was very educational at the same time its fun so it makes it really easy to retain. However, it's not that it is need but it would be greatly appreaciated, esp. for a non-native speaker like me, if you could also add a function where we could hear the proper pronunciation but over all, it is extremely helpful and accessible for everyone, no need to pay for anything! Thank you!","2020-07",159,"+effect,+short,+fun,+listen,+wish"],[5,"It's a great app to learn new vocabulary! I like it when you answered one wrong and you have a chance to go over it again later to correct it. What a good way to memorize and understand it! Just a little problem (though I already mentioned this thru email feedback), sometimes I cannot comprehend the voice app for pronunciation. Hopefully someday they add options to change the voice. It's a great app, nevertheless!","2021-04",157,"+effect,+listen"],[5,"As a lover of language, I find this app incredibly useful. Recovering my vocabulary is very important to me, and the simplicity of the flashcards have been the biggest help! At first I wasn't sure about the appearance of the thing, but honestly I appreciate how distraction-free it all is. 10/10 excellent! My only criticism is that sometimes the examples/definition can be a bit vague (or incomplete) but if the point is familiarity and growing comprehension, it's still done its job. :)","2020-07",156,"+review,+exam,+free"],[5,"The application is good, and I'm satisfied with the UI/UX. I would like to recommend a crucial functionality in terms of UX. The application should allow users to copy 'sentence examples' so that we can easily search outside the application. As an Urdu speaker, I often need to translate sentences into Urdu. Currently, I have to write the complete sentence on Google for the search. It would greatly enhance the user experience if the developers could add text copy functionality. Thanks","2023-11",154,"+exam"],[3,"This is really a helpful app to improve vocab but there could be some improvements. I) A word has more than one meanings and in some cases they are slightly or totally different. In this app we get only a single word to define the target word and sometimes it causes confusion. You should define each word comprehensively. 2)Besides defining a word, you should tell its grammatical function and category. 3)Examples given are often difficult, sometimes totally unknown. Make them easy for learners.","2021-08",151,"wish,+effect,+short,+exam,+wish"],[5,"This is an Excellent Platform for harnessing ones vocabulary! It doesn't only give you the correct answer for incorrect words, but it brings it up until you have mastered it. Therefore, Making it an amazing learning experience for you. Moreover, there are different levels of English for people with different proficiencies in the English Language. I would definitely recommend this application to someone else, If Asked.","2021-02",144,""],[4,"The app is truly a very helpful one when it comes to building a strong vocabulary base for standardized tests. However, one feature that should be added is allowing users to \"mark/select/add to a list\" of words that they get wrong or find difficult. This will allow the users to practice those words exclusively afterwards.","2020-08",141,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"I think so far this app is really good. I'm a proficient reader and was 5 grades ahead of my peers as a child... I've selected \"wrong\" answers at level one because they are without context. For example, Constraint means \"limit\" but I selected tightness. Clearly the word was chosen because it can be used that way. I think someone honing English may be confused by this type of oversight. I just started so I'll see how it goes.","2024-07",141,"+exam"],[5,"The best app for vocab building. I came across so many new words which I never knew and yet, it has done nothing but good! I appreciate the way the app has been organized too since it keeps showing our incorrect words again and again. At times it definitely irritates me, won't be denying that 😂, however, for the results, even if you are done with the same words, it still gets helpful and thus this app is great in the long run. Love this app, the best one ever made for competitive exams!!! 😃😃","2022-04",140,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[4,"This app aided me well in learning new vocabulary words efficiently which is very good as it improved my confidence when it comes to speaking, writing, and thinking. The only thing I ask for is that I wish for there to be an option to where I can choose a different person for pronouncing the words as sometimes I feel as the male who pronounces the words doesnt do so to the extent where I'm 100% confident in being able to mimic the pronouncitation.","2020-09",139,"+effect,+wish"],[4,"*I am not a student. I am a grad degree-holding adult who wanted a way to quickly increase my vocabulary of advanced words.* The app style is VERY user friendly. I would give it 5/5 but for 2 issues. First, I didn't fully agree with some of the meanings given to certain advanced words. But, far more important, I felt this did not have enough highly advanced words. I wish there were several higher levels where I didn't already know at least half of the words. But it still increased my vocab.","2022-02",138,"+short,+wish"],[4,"I've been using this app for an hour or two and it provides a nice and clean learning environment without ads. Please look into the example for the word \"negligible\", it seems there's a problem with it being shown, also in the example of the word \"catalyst\" Rosa Parks' is spelled \"Rosa Park's\". I also think you can provide part of speech for each item to further enrich the app experience.","2021-09",129,"+exam,+free"],[4,"I love this app because it's awesome! It helps me realize how much we change the definition to words we use to help create our own language. The only issue i have with this app at the moment is that they don't make clear if the word is an Adj. Or a Verb or Noun. They had a word \"Check\" and the best synonym or definition was \"(n) a stopping or slowing of progress.\" When I immediately thought to examine (v). Meh not a big deal but it's would be nice.","2022-04",128,"+effect,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Great app for learning new words, quite fun and addicting too. It's nice that you get examples to help you get a picture of how words are supposed to be used, but more details regarding each word's grammatical category and classifying which speech style each word belongs to (formal or informal), would be a helpful addition. It doesn't have to be too in-depth, just a couple of tips to help users understand when and how to use the new words.","2020-12",124,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[2,"App is well made but content is of poor quality. Word definitions do not capture nuance and are often not even the right part of speech. All definitions are very imprecise. Example sentences are usually fine.","2019-07",117,"voice"],[5,"I love Vocabulary Builder, it helps me to remember the words I have learnt through frequent use of the app. I have also learnt so many more words and am improving my vocabulary every day. I can use it when I am waiting, so it is convenient and doesn't take excessive time out of my busy day. I recommend it to anyone who wants to improve their vocabulary.","2020-09",117,"+effect,+short,+habit,+wish"],[1,"For native English speakers, especially, answers offered are often ambiguous. Descriptions are ill fitting at the best of times and the definitions incorrect or lacking nuance. If you're a native speaker this is a no no. For beginners/learners of English, I especially advise against this app, you will be taught incorrectly.","2021-05",114,"wrong"],[4,"I'm not studying for the GRE, but this has been a useful app for strengthening my vocabulary. But I don't believe there are obvious opportunities to go back and study specific words without studying everything in a given section, though, so it could be improved. EDIT: More specifically, if there were a way to see which words you got wrong in your online matches, this app would be perfect for me. I love the matches, but I wonder if I'm really learning much when I forget which words were wrong.","2019-08",110,"+effect,+review,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Very good. Simple interface - in a good way - makes learning the meanings of words painless, even fun. The level of randomness, and the amount and timing of repetition of words is excellent. There are a lot of words but I feel like there could be even more; there are just so many words in the language! All that said, what we were really looking for was prep for the SSAT (and in the fall, the ISEE). My son is working with the SAT words for now.","2024-06",109,"+short,+review,+fun,+exam"],[4,"Multiple choice is quick and addictive. It makes the learning easy. It gives the learner a sense of success. However, it will be nice to have another set of tests where the vocabulary is shown in a sentence and the learner needs to write the meaning. I don't know whether the technology can handle the various options that come in and evaluate the acceptable ones to give a positive reward. Nevertheless, the learner will eventually learn the acceptable answers and type in the proper words.","2020-11",102,"+short,+fun,+exam"],[3,"Hi Magoosh. I'm a paid subscriber of your products. I would like to add something. When you don't know the meaning of a word, the right meaning is shown and then the words are asked again later. But, since the options are pretty much the exact same with the order shuffled around, I'm associating the right answer for a word with that option without actually understanding it. I'm sure many people face the same issue. Please change the options and change the correct option to a synonym.","2023-09",101,"pay"],[1,"My entire progress got cleared even though I have an account. I was on intermediate level and now it shows those levels as locked. Even after starting all over again, some levels are not getting cleared even after getting all questions right. Please fix this as I really liked this app and am using it daily for my GRE practice. 10/02- Now even the levels are disappearing. I passed level 3 and it promoted me to level 6 skipping 2 levels altogether. I'm disappointed. Please fix this asap","2019-02",100,"data,wish"],[2,"My progress keeps getting lost, the levels which I have completed are again greyed out as incomplete. Fix this issue, also levels come out of order somtimes ie level 7 and 8 are coming before level 5","2019-08",100,""],[2,"You can't learn a word completely that you can even use it correctly in your daily conversations with one word definition and just one example and NOT explanation at all. This is way far from learn. This is more memorizing than learning. But Thanks it may took lots of time to create the app. It needs more information to learn a new word. English is my second language and this method just confused me.","2021-08",91,""],[5,"Quick and organized way to expand vocabulary, words categorized based on difficulty level, and each section will repeat mistaken words until you get it. Quite like anki but with choices. the only down side is it offers a singular definition of the word and a singular example. This is good if you wanted a quick brush up without the extensive read. The short definitions are accurate, anyway. I suggest looking up a completely foreign word in a dictionary if you feel like you need more context.","2020-07",91,"+short,+exam"],[4,"the good: 1. free 2. no ads 3. easy to use, 4. good collection of words, 5. nice memory reinforcement mechanism ====== What can be improved: 1. all categories seem to be based on the same set of words. More variation would be good. 2. may want to show context before asking questions since the choices are often ambiguous or even misleading without the context. 3. words with multiple meanings should be tested for each meaning if possible overall, this is a great app. Good job. Well done!","2019-09",88,"+effect,+short,+exam,+free,+wish"],[4,"I love new words and I like to knowing simpler way to describe what they mean. This app is perfect for people who want to use words in a more intelligent manner. I hear too many people use words they do not know the meaning to. However, I would not mind learning more uncommon words. 'Tis just a thought though. Thank you for this app. I use it when I have free time and it has helped me to be confident in the words that I use every day.","2020-06",88,"+effect,+short,+habit,+free"],[1,"I don't expect much from a flash-card vocabulary app because there is not much complexity to compiling a list of words and definitions (and slightly wrong definitions for multiple choice options). This app is NOT a vocabulary builder. It does NOT reference definitions, but rather presents 1-2 \"synonyms\" which refer more to the context of use than the definition of the word itself. Some definitions are just incorrect (some owing to regional differences in UK vs US English). 0/10 do not recommend.","2021-08",80,"wrong"],[5,"I honestly love the app. It has helped me a lot with GRE vocab and I am seeing advancements pretty quickly. However, the in-game feature would be more challenging if both competitors are really active at the same time; i.e. not having to wait (even for more than 12 hours) for the other person to answer a given round. Still, worth the five stars.","2019-10",75,"+effect,+short,+fun,+exam"],[5,"I had a good vocabulary already but this app has definitely increased it! On average about 15% of the words are ones I did not know at all or had heard but never knew the meaning. Even for the ones I do know already, a refresher is always nice! Absolutely recommend if you want to increase your vocabulary!","2020-10",75,""],[4,"it's a good app to learn from. It's good for practice aswell. The only problem is some words have many meanings and it would be better if we are given an option to type the meanings instead of choosing options. Also, some meanings aren't quite suitable for the words but it's not a big problem. I think switching the position of the questions and answers would be better. Ex: catalyst is cause of a process. You can ask: Q: Cause of a process Ans: catalyst","2020-04",74,""],[4,"Learned a lot of words, but still struggle with the actual meaning because of the lack of complete definition when the answers are revealed. For example adding words like \"to be _ is to be fearful\" to the definition would be more helpful, rather than just \"fear\". It's very hard to remember new words when you are showed only synonyms. Obviously just \"fear\" is good enough for the multiple choice. Please take this into consideration. But overall ejoyed this app, could be 5/5.","2021-06",74,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"Nice app to improve and practice vocabulary. Different levels in the app help you to organize your learning according to complexity of words. The UX is awesome. App does not have an advertisement and the experience is seamless.It can be very useful for the folks preparing competitive exams and those who are looking for growth in their career by improving their basket of vocabulary they know. Would recommend everyone to regularly spend atleast 15 minutes on it daily to improve their knowledge.","2021-11",74,"+effect,+short,+fun,+exam,+habit,+wish"],[4,"I've steadily been able to learn some new vocabulary. While multiple choice is great the first few times, I wish I could also do fill in the blank or questions like the normal GRE format as well just to change it up a bit. I defintely like the random word challenge with other people. One other reccomendation: a new level could be created with just words you've gotten wrong from completing all the levels in one section. This allows us to test ourselves again without having to go through 1-7 lvs.","2020-05",73,"+exam,+wish"],[2,"Some of the levels reset automatically and some are in misplaced orders, making it difficult to navigate. Also, due to these misplaced levels, some are locked from access where I am unable to progress.","2019-06",72,"data"],[4,"Words are never ending, always fun to learn a new word, with a lot of practice. Though there is room for improvement as always. I think there can be a practice test after every level, so that learners could test if they really memorized the Words. Also examples could be far more than better. Believe me the app is great and easy to use. Best for your essays and exams but there is still a room or improvement.","2024-10",72,"+effect,+short,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Great vocabulary builder. The GUI is simple and attractive. I've been using it for the GRE in addition to my anki deck. I recommend using this app and creating an anki deck for the words you don't know. Anki will tax your active recall more, since you don't have options to choose from, but this app will nevertheless give you an initiation into those words and how they're used. Great free resource!","2020-11",70,"+short,+exam,+free"],[5,"This is such a great app if you want to learn new vocab words! It won't let you pass a chapter until you've got everything down, and it doesn't matter if you fail or not, you can easily come back to it! They're like flashcards, they give you the words, definitions, how to pronounce them, and examples! Highly recommend!!","2022-08",69,"+review,+exam"],[5,"Very good app for all those with weak vocabulary. Its makes learning words easier and fun. I absolutely love it. All those are having problem in the GRE Verbal section can use this to improve their performance. I can't tell about how useful this is for the SATs and other exams because I haven't used it for those exams. But for GRE preparations this app is a must have! This is really good","2020-05",69,"+fun,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Good app for practicing vocab for GRE. Only thing I've noticed is some of the words appear to have multiple potential \"correct\" definitions depending on context. I appreciate that the app teaches alternative definitions for words, but it would be nice to have a bit of context in the prompt. I've begun to start assuming words are using their lesser known definitions and have been performing better since.","2024-11",68,"+exam,+wish"],[4,"For non english professionals, who commonly use repeated regular but basic words are usually don't know how to speak and understand difficult words, for all such people it is a very nice application. I suggest that english is mostly from latin and greek, you should include meaning of most words like, prefix and postfix, in this way people will memorize difficult words well.","2021-03",67,"+effect"],[4,"I'm trying to work on my vocabulary to improve my writing. It is challenging. I find the \"I'm not sure\" option and the pronouciation helpful. It keeps me from refering to my misconception of the word. I am very surprised with how a subtle meaning is often the correct choice. I do still have to stop snd look up the word origin on line to enhance my understanding.Thanks!","2021-04",64,"+effect,+wish"],[5,"Excellent app,l. Very simple but effective for both English learners, or native speakers looking to improve their vocabulary. The online aspect can be fun and serves as an excellent way to solidify your memorization of the words in the section. Only thing that could be improved, is on rare occasions some of the definitions that you have to choose from a very similar making it a bit of a guess between the two.","2021-06",64,"+effect,+short,+fun,+wish"],[5,"I was preparing SAT and it is a fantastic app. Only one major drawback tho: it is recognizable. Like when I don't remember the word spurn, I looked at the choices and I remember some words that were not answers previously. So, I could have easily avoided them. So, I would like to suggest that to mix with other words that were not previously used. Thanks a million.","2025-03",63,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"Absolutely great app for vocabulary building as one prepares for the GRE. It's helps you to learn the words quickly, allows you to choose your options before the correct answer is revealed, and the answer, and it allows you to play a game with others as you progress in the game. Way to use, accurate and effective. I only wish that the app will show the figure of speech that each word belongs to. That will and better comprehension of the word. Hi ahead and download.","2019-05",62,"+effect,+short,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[1,"Doesnt save your latest development (status). It keeps forgetting it and you have redo the levels and words again and again which is super annoying!","2019-09",61,"ui"],[5,"This is a great app. It offers 50 important vocabulary words in each level of easy, medium, hard, and common (200 in total) . With pronunciation, meaning, and example. It's not reviewing words only one and not a lot to kill the interest. only I faced 2 vocabularies that didn't have pronunciation. Maybe it makes your app very better if you improve that. Keep a good job up, and thanks.","2023-07",61,"+short,+review,+listen,+exam,+wish"],[5,"I am thoroughly impressed with this app. I love expanding my vocab. However, the past few years, I have only occasionally been able to find new words while searching. In contrast, this app has almost exclusively words that are new to me. It's awesome! (Just for clarity, I have almost exclusively used the GRE Prep section of the app.) I also really like how fast it feeds you the flash cards. Rather than giving you 25 words to learn all at once, it cycles you through about 5 at any given moment.","2020-03",61,"+exam"],[3,"1. A bookmark option is a must which is missing. Only viewing wrong words multiple times won't help in the long run. 2. More synonyms/antonyms should be added. 3. More than one example is required as many of the words have multiple meanings and usage. 4. System for quizzing should be incorporated. Rather than just sliding the words at will.","2021-11",60,"bug,+exam"],[4,"If you're trying to expanded your synonym vocabulary its okay at best. I want to be able to save words, so I can review later. Needs a review mode where I can \"learn\" prior from guessing and then remembering the answers. It promotes guessing, the \"im not sure\" is there but its not the same, especially if you dont know what the word or its answers mean. I was often surprised at the \"examples\" instead of a definitive definition. Overall 4 stars, for ease of use, good words, and interface.","2022-02",59,"+effect,+review,+exam"],[5,"It's a great app for anyone who's looking forward to learn to words Every single day but hasn't been able to accomplish it. First of all it does have a lot of words but the best part about it is, it actually makes you learn the meaning of it. The word's repeatedly shown until you get it right atleast thrice. It's totally big free, and also very simple and handy!","2020-07",59,"+short,+free"],[5,"The best thing about this app is the way it keeps pace with my learning speed. I would totally recommend someone who is thriving to build his or her vocabulary. If I may suggest, I would like the app to include short assignments like creating a sentence or a paragraph using words learnt in a specific level, and run a check on their proper use.","2020-04",56,"+short"],[4,"I found this app very much helpful to me. But I noticed that while learning and reviewing, it shows the same option as answer that came before. So, instead of this if a synonym or other related meaning answer is shown, it would help more in learning that word. It looks like, I remember the same option, not learning or understanding actual meaning of the word.","2018-11",55,"+effect,+review"],[5,"Great app as a tool to help you increase your GRE verbal score! For reference, I scored above the 90th percentile this past September. I would not solely rely on the app alone; however, as a free supplemental study aid, I personally believe it delivered as described. The list of words are both appropriate and relevant for the GRE test. Easy to pull up and get right into, whether at home, work or really anywhere. :)","2019-10",55,"+short,+exam,+free"],[4,"Thanks for this helpful app. The words chosen are relevant to the GRE test and the way they are presented to the learner makes sense to me but the definitions and examples could be richer to help create a more accurate idea about the new items. Also, more task types (e.g. gap-filling, multiple matching,...) could be used especially for reviewing new items.","2022-05",52,"+effect,+review,+exam"],[5,"I highly recommend this app. I use it with my 11 yr old for fun. We both learn and enjoy it. The app helps with not only learning new words but also with remembering them through repetition and great examples. I also like that the app provides the pronunciation along with a sentence for proper usage.","2021-03",52,"+effect,+review,+fun,+listen,+exam"],[5,"I've been using the app for two weeks now and it is super helpful esp. on enhancing one's vocabulary. It provides example on each word which makes it easy for one to understand and how to use it. Since it saves your progress and is accessible, you can include it on your work-life daily routine for just 15-30 minutes. Thank youuu, GRE Vocabulary Builder!","2020-02",51,"+effect,+short,+exam,+habit"],[5,"Love it!! I have Aphasia and the best solution I've found is to have as large a vocabulary as possible. So when I can't think of a word, I have others (which itself often prompts my memory to produce the original word). This app is brilliant - and because it rewards correct answers, but doesn't punish wrong ones - I don't get frustrated when I mess up.","2023-04",49,""],[4,"Overall it's a good app. Informative, useful, knowledgeable and smooth. But, the thing that concern me is of the material the app provide, the materials are so limited for ex: prepration for ielts vocabulary consists of not more than 12 exercise. Excluding that the app is so good. You can rely on it atleast for your basic grammer and get some vocabulary earned in your free time.","2022-01",48,"+exam,+free"],[4,"I would give it a five stars and recommend it, if the Devs would add a promising feature in the app. The problem is let's say under the Advanced section of GRE Words,level 1, it would be better if there could be more words on that level which keeps changing every week. The reason is that it becomes dull, that on every level only limited 10 words are gonna be there. It would be better if on any level, we could have more words to memorize after every week.Rest, Love the app and the concept!","2021-01",48,"+effect,+exam"],[3,"Quite a few things wrong with this app. The audio of the word takes a long time to load. The audio for the word should be available at the guessing stage. The stand alone definitions are sometime nonsensical in context to the word. The example sentences are also hit or miss in their description of the word. I give this app a pass but there is loads of improvement needed.","2020-02",47,"wish,+listen,+exam,+wish"],[5,"This app is awesome and has a great methodology of teaching that manages to be simple yet tricky enough to the point where I actually end up learning the meaning of the words (though I'm finding I forget the words themselves even though I remember the definition). It's be nice to have a \"hard\" review mode where you type in the meaning or something along those lines. I feel that would further reinforce the learning! Great app though and I hope it expands my vocabulary over time.","2020-03",47,"+effect,+short,+review,+wish"],[4,"This is very good app, with nice, clean and ad-free interface. I have one request. Presently only one (usually) complex sentence is there for every word. Please provide multiple sentences for each word so that meaning and usage becomes more clear, and also becomes easier to remember.","2024-07",45,"+effect,+free"],[4,"It's a nice and helpful app, I only want to remark two points: 1) It would be much better if people could also add their desired sentence for every word, would be very helpful! 2) I expected more words! For example in GRE section, there are roughly 1000 words, I guess you need more words to have a good score in verbal section of the GRE test! Anyway, still helpful enough; recommended! thank you Magoosh 👍","2021-07",44,"+effect,+exam"],[4,"I'm using this app for 3-4 days now. I haven't tried any other vocabulary apps so I can't compare it. It has a really nice collection of words and it helps to learn new words too but one thing that really bugs me is that the app does not include a definition of the word, now since it can get hard sometime to understand a word if the word used to describe it is not already known to us, examples are great but not that helpful in some cases. Definitions would really help learn the meaning behind a word instead of just rote memorizing. Overall great app!","2021-10",41,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"I love this app , it's very helpful every english learner should use this to build vocabulary. But it would be much better if you add some more features like: vocabulary related to any specific topic, another level where we have to give the answer without seeing options, or we can add vocabulary by ourselves according to our need i mean something which can give us what we exactly want to learn. And one more thing detailed explanation of the words. It would be much more helpful with these feature","2023-03",41,"+effect"],[5,"This is one of the best apps out there for anyone looking to improve and expand their vocabulary. It comes with simple yet efficient user interfaces, making it very easy to use and follow. The lessons/lists are well organized and the example sentences are all really top-notch, helping learners memorize new words faster by providing relevant, easy-to-understand contexts.","2020-07",40,"+effect,+short,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Great app for expanding vocabulary. Love the level of repetition and the multiple choice format. Suggestion: 1. To enhance the process of learning: Automatically sound the words as they firsts appear on the screen, I find hearing the sound and seeing the word written, allows me to remember words faster and better. 2. If you had an Urban Vocabulary Builder, that would be Sweariously (that's one of my own words :)) epic!:)","2020-04",39,"+effect,+review,+custom"],[5,"I've always loved words, thee ability to express yourself whether verbally or on paper; so having a vast vocabulary is paramount. This is great app for learning new, more concise and descriptive words. Some people may feel that going over the same word (that u didn't know or got wrong) is repetitious or tedious, but this helps retention. A great learning tool!!","2020-03",36,"+effect"],[3,"Can use improvement. Every lesson is excessively long and shows me the same words I've gotten correct over and over again. I just want to learn a couple words in my spare time but it takes forever to get through these lessons. And then I try to play the competitive game against someone else and I don't even have the time to read the definitions before my turn is over. Make lesson shorter and make the game mode longer and I'll be much happier.","2023-09",35,"repeat,wish,+short,+fun,+wish"],[1,"Too boring, add some pics or gifs to better understand the word. The way of teaching a word used at the app at present is way too old and outdated","2020-01",34,"repeat"],[5,"English is probably my strongest suit academically and I love to write, but I've always felt like my command of obscure vocabulary words has been a bit lacking. This app is excellent at helping you learn those tricky, lesser known words, and it quizzes you over and over until the material actually sinks in. The audio pronunciations are a useful feature, too. Great app for polishing up on those fancy words that will enrich your vocabulary, and it's fun to play!","2022-04",33,"+fun,+listen,+custom"],[5,"Really liked the 3 level setup; beginner, intermediate and advance. I am able to learn some really new and challenging words whenever I invest my 30mins of time. Looking forward to building a strong and robust vocabulary. Happy Learning Edit 1- I'd recommend this vocabulary builder app to achieve a meteoric learning over a transitory one. It shall have a telling improvement in your choice of words. Erring early is better than later.","2021-06",33,"+wish"],[4,"This app is quite helpful, but if you are a beginner you need help from google as well. Moreover one word has various meanings, in this app one word is used in a particular form, lacks variety. In addition to that the options for the words remain same which is short term memory kinda thing. For the longer period try writing those words separately and learn them","2022-12",32,"+effect,+short"],[4,"I love this app so much. My vocabulary has improved very much and I've only been using it for one week. However, I did find two or three words whose meanings were a bit different and I almost used them in the wrong situation. If there's a word you know but you're not sure of the definition given, I definitely recommend googling just for confirmation. Other than that, wonderful app.","2021-06",32,"+effect,+wish"],[4,"Its an excellent application. I liked it alot just I have posted 4 stars in the rating because I have a suggestion that when the answer is given by the learner there come's a example I think with that you should give a simplified definition which will be in sentence which we can easily see on Google so that we can understand the word easily and can quickly memorize it . But living this aside the application is superb.☺","2020-11",32,"+effect,+short,+exam"],[4,"The app as a whole is phenomenal. Addition of example sentences to help understand the meanings is superb. I faced a few hiccups, the progress sometimes just disappears and I have to start all over again😞. Would love to have a bookmark feature for quick revision. That's why a star less in the rating😉","2020-08",32,"+short,+exam"],[4,"Installed the app a few days ago and ever since then I've been using it regularly. Whenever I'm sitting idle or if I have a few words I quickly start the app and start revising the words. I wish I could also add my own words because I have a huge repository of them. They can also add expressions like phrases and common sayings.","2020-08",32,"+short,+custom,+wish"],[3,"On the fence with this... I appreciate the quiz like style of learning. However, there are some mistakes and definitions that are archaic rather than more typical usage. Example: \"artless\" had both \"unskilled\" and \"without deception\" as potential choices, which are both correct though only \"without deception\" is accepted. I'd also appreciate sharing a definition that is more than one word... But hey it's a free app and the word lists are well chosen. Just have a dictionary open when learning!","2024-04",31,"wrong,+exam,+free"],[4,"Simple app, testing a user's knowledge by asking them to select the best short definition for a word, and repeating words that were unknown or guessed incorrectly. I am trying to improve my vocabulary and my eloquence in general. It would be very useful for me to test how well I could use or find the right words in a sentence, with and without options to select from.","2021-10",31,"+short,+exam,+wish"],[4,"The app is pretty good. The content is vast and it's very easy to use. Personally though I would have loved a bookmark option wherein I could bookmark the words I wasn't comfortable with, or the words I had trouble remembering after a few days so that I could review the troubled list separately. Otherwise a great app!","2019-12",31,"+effect,+short,+review"],[5,"This app is amazing, I really wanted to enhance my vocabulary, and does it just right, maybe even more than needed, I got results in the first week of using the app, I could use the words I learnt effectively for writing passages, so and so. So, I would 'irrefutablely' tell one to use this app. And a tip, to get results quickly , try to use it daily. Trust.","2026-02",31,"+effect,+short,+habit"],[5,"I just studied the high school vocabulary rounds 1-4 and my memory, it operated effectively fast like a brand new computer system. I enjoy Vocabulary Builder because this app is good at example sentences, it challenges you to see if you remembered what was the correct definition of each wordage, and last but not least, Vocabulary Builder is the educational system for those who wish to build a educated vocabulary. Tomorrow I will finish round 5. Then I will advance forth.","2020-05",30,"+effect,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[1,"The game has a lot of misrepresented words. While the goal is to select the best definition, there are answer that are twisted and some that are outright wrong. For someone who is just learning the language or building vocabulary, this may be critical if not corrected. Challenging someone doesnt work too.","2020-03",28,"bug"],[5,"I would definately recommend this vocabulary builder app because it is a fun and sufficient way to expand your vocabulary. I'm mastered all the words on the vocabulary builder and I like to write down the definitions so I don't forget. My vocabulary has extended immensly. I give vocab builder 5 stars.","2021-02",28,"+review,+fun"],[5,"This app is perfect for building my vocabulary and I love ❤️ it! No ads has professional speech pronunciations and best of all, it's free. I'd highly recommend it as I use this app on the (daily basis) as part of my usual mundane. Only thing I don't like is sometimes it won't pronounce the words like it should. With no audio speech 💭 which is bad! But nice little feature to include a competitive game to compete with real people and to see who is more knowledgeable about said words, 5 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ app.","2022-06",27,"+fun,+listen,+habit,+free"],[2,"The design is more geared for pattern recognition of multiple choice answers rather than actually learning definitions. No option to conceal answers and no dual-sided flashcards so you're more likely to forget. You sometimes get 10+ new words in a row before a review, ensuring you've completely forgotten anything recently learned; and sometimes you'll get a brand new word almost back to back, which is almost just as bad. Also needs parts of speech, and many pronunciations are still missing.","2024-05",26,"voice,ui"],[5,"Recently I've been struggling with my vocabulary although I know alot of intermediate words but still I wanted to learn more. l researched alot on finding a tremendous app to learn new vocabulary and I did . It's the far best app I have downloaded to learn vocabulary. It not only just teaches you according to your level but also when you make a mistake it shows you that particular word couple of times so that you can master it .","2023-02",26,""],[1,"I like the idea. But, once passed level 4 or 5, I get signed out, and the progress resets randomly every time I login again. In other words, I can't reach the end of the module unless I do it in one go.","2023-10",25,"data"],[3,"The app is helping me learn new words, I like it enough to continue, but there are a few odd glitches, like when you try to replay a level immediately and it just shows 1 question and then says that you completed it, or level 3 being after level 5 in advanced ACT & SAT. Probably a few others I haven't found. I also wish there was an option to type rather than multiple choice, to check you can remember the definition normally, or even just a reverse version. The vs mode doesn't seem t work either","2019-09",25,"bug,wish,+effect,+exam,+wish"],[5,"This Is the really the best app for vocabulary i have ever found here, designed in a very effective way and the flashcards really help in a big way. We can learn words from easy to difficult and I have found this really helpful for me. It's overall a great app. If there would be some sound, It will become more addictive.","2020-05",25,"+effect,+short,+review,+fun"],[1,"Some of the answers that are marked wrong could technically be right. Words are repeated too many times on a level, regardless if you get it right or wrong. Kind of hard to remember the definitions of 30-60 words that quick. And the games are stupid. I feel like it should let you get as many out of 20 right, instead of kicking you out once you get one of them wrong. Uninstalled after a few hours.","2020-01",24,"repeat"],[4,"This is great app for people who know academics English well yet fails somewhere in vocabulary of competitive exams like toefl, sat etc. If they want to improve it, I would suggest this app is best for them.. Best thing I liked is the challenge play where we can compete with different people & can take it as a self test. It helps in revision of the words we had studied.. So good luck! Go ahead!👍","2020-06",24,"+effect,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Very effective in terms of vocabulary build up. Useful for anyone who are fascinate towards english and want to increase his/her vocabulary. For team who made this app there should be option where you can check other word meaning from the given option. That will help to understand those words too at the same time. Keep the good work going. 😊😇","2020-05",24,"+effect"],[5,"It's an excellent app. Over the years I have ameliorated by vocabulary to an advanced level. I feel more confident and also learning new words has made the language more interesting. I recommend to start using this app from 8th grade and they'll expand the horizons of their speaking and writing skills.","2021-04",24,""],[1,"Don't install or log in! After you do you will receive e-mails everyday! If you try to unsubscribe, it says that you successfully unsubscribed and then you'll get e-mails from another e-mail address and so on and so on. The app is not worth the spam!","2020-12",22,"pay,data"],[3,"Great review words and difficulty levels; however the app keeps resetting my levels and I have to start over. I keep reviewing the same easy and intermediate words and never advance past them before it resets again! You also can't skip levels either, they unlock so theres no way for me to advance without starting fresh.","2019-09",22,"data,+short,+review"],[4,"I have been using the app for a short period of time, my observations so far have been extremely positive. The app is a valuable resource for expanding your vocabulary. The main problem with the app is the lack of word definitions, this omission has an adverse affect on learning and consolidation. The inclusion of definitions would greatly benifit the app. Thank you.","2021-07",22,"+short"],[4,"This app is cool and splendid. It transform me to a cheerful dispostion. It solve a persons queries and doubts regarding new advanced words and it act like a motivational speaker,which I can hear a motto \"DO IT, DO IT, until YOU SCHOLARY LEARNED\". I recommend this app,where you can sure learn newly words in english without a class. Everything optimistic!😊😍🙋💪💖","2020-09",22,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[1,"Not suitable for native English speakers. It has very limited and incomplete definitions of words and isn't suited to anyone who truly wants to master a language. The choices for words are all very different and don't capture the nuances of when a word should be chosen over another, similar word. There is no discussion of etymology or language roots which would explain WHY a word means what it does. If you want to learn I would suggest reading dictionary definitions over this app. 1/5","2020-09",21,"lack"],[2,"This app has great potential, however it falls short for too many reasons. It doesn't offer definitions, but rather very loosely related synonyms, and frequently the \"correct\" answer isn't even the MOST correct option. The sentences are pretty pointless and offer zero classification.","2018-10",21,""],[3,"This is an amazing resource for learning GRE vocab. And it has been helping me immensely to memorise new words in a very effective manner. But the only problem I have, and the reason I have given only 3 stars, is that the amount of words that each level contains is too much! It would be so nice if there were say only 10 words in each level and the no of levels could be increased. The less no of words per level would make it much easier to prepare each level efficiently, 10 words at a time.","2019-08",21,"+effect,+exam"],[4,"This app helps me a lot with different kinds of Vocabulary, it also has a good feature. For instance its theme like when we're playing games...... But sometimes It's a bit boring because they only show the words without drawings / pictures. Overall, everything is acceptable. Keep it up!","2020-01",21,"+effect,+fun"],[3,"Great app love it overall. If i choose \"replay this level\" I will be given a randomly-sized fraction of the whole level. If i wish to replay the entire level, I have to do that random portion before given the opportunity to complete the entire level. Suddenly it's taking 30 seconds to load a pronunciation, if it will load at all, often only after several button presses. Sometimes the pronunciations will play after having given up and moved on to another word. Sometimes it's possible two pronunciations will play simultaneously when the play button is pressed on a new word. The pronunciations have never loaded swiftly. The files should exist in the app to eliminate any lag. The reliance on the internet for the pronunciations is an absurd design choice for 2018 moving forward that would be easy enough to remedy.","2018-11",20,"bug,voice,ui,wish,+short,+listen,+wish"],[5,"I've been using this app for a few months on and off to study for the GRE. Now that my test is approaching quickly, I've been using it more frequently, and it's really user-friendly. I recommend it for others who are also studying for the GRE! It doesn't crash, doesn't seem like there are any bugs, and if you create a free account you can sync your progress across multiple devices--I have it synced with my Pixel 2 and my iPad.","2019-03",20,"+short,+exam,+free"],[5,"A must use app to maximize English score in UPSC, TOEFL, IELTS, GRE, GATE &CAT. Really such an amazing app I've never been to. It's the paragon of the few free English vocabulary apps available out there. It makes you go through a mistake made countable times so that you won't forget it down the time. Has exquisite collection of sentences for each word giving us an insight bout' the use of such words in our daily lives. A must use app to master English Vocab at various levels. Learn 1000 words.","2020-02",20,"+review,+exam,+habit,+free"],[1,"too many of these words rely on context and have multiple definitions yet the synonyms you are given are unclear, too similar to others or outright incorrect. for instance, i was quizzed for \"discrete\" twice - once it meant \"careful\" yet the second time it meant \"divide\". second, \"assumption\" is NOT a synonym for presumption! how can you have an app do ONE thing and do that ONE thing wrong? it would be better to give the definition of a word and have users try to work it into a sentence.","2021-10",19,"wrong"],[4,"I like the interface and the app is great in general, however, some of the correct answers are not what you expect. For example, for the word qualify. I know exactly what that means and everyone only uses it one way that I know of, but the answer is a definition I've never seen anyone use. It's okay if the words are strange and not used often, but not if there's a very common definition you're ignoring in favour of a less used one. It's misleading for ESL people.","2023-07",19,"+exam"],[5,"It is a useful application-cum-game for learning and memorising English vocabulary. I especially find its program that ascertains the learning of a word by repeatedly displaying it before the player and it presents it until the word has been learnt. However, if the words/vocabularies have their different parts of speech mentioned before them, learners will find it more helpful.","2025-03",18,"+effect,+fun"],[1,"Censor - to remove objectionable material. This is not an acceptable definition. It assumes that censored material is always objectionable. This is entirely subjective, obvious by provincial differences in what is objected to. After using the app for barely a few minutes I have noticed that many of the word definitions are only vaguely correct, leading to a mis-understanding of the true meaning of the word. And that was at the very basic level. Please, use a dictionary or thesaurus instead.","2021-03",17,""],[2,"I don't really like this app. Few words have different meaning based on which context it is used in. Hence, they should give you the context. Secondly, the vocabulary in this app is quite basic. It's almost as if it's made to please the users when they chose the correct meaning. It should be educational, hence it should have a wider and advance set of vocabulary.","2022-05",17,"lack,wish"],[4,"it's really helping me for an exam. Yet, there are some things I wish could improve: 1. after I don't know an answer or make the wrong choice, the word shows up a lot and too often that I don't get time to practice other words and feel exhausted. 2. I need a word review mode to review what I have learned 3. I need some analytics 4. I need a list of all words to have a look some time or make a favorite list to practice more. I sometimes don't even know the synonym word! I also need a definition.","2019-04",17,"+effect,+review,+exam,+wish"],[5,"This is honestly the best vocab app I've used so far !very convenient and has really great features like the \"I'm not sure\" one and i love how it makes you master the words and gives you the complete definition of the words with pronounciation and their use in a sentence ,,I have to prepare for an entrance exam and I'm loving the SAT levels!","2019-01",17,"+short,+exam"],[5,"This app is really easy to use, and the interface is very neat. There are no ads either, which is a nice surprise. The only criticism that I have is that the example sentences sometimes have typos or end abruptly in the middle of the sentence. If they just had an editor to go over it, the app would be perfect. As it stands, it's still very good.","2020-07",16,"+short,+exam,+free"],[1,"Lost all my progress as I hadn't signed in...then I signed in and after that everytime I close the app it signs out and every single time I have to sign in and even then sometimes last portion of progress gets lost.Happening since last 2 weeks. Seems some new bug . MUST FIX","2023-09",15,"bug,data"],[1,"My primary gripe with this app is that words might have many meanings at times. Discriminate, for example, has two meanings: the first is to differentiate, and the second is to treat someone or a group of people unfairly. It happens frequently, and I occasionally get the answer wrong.","2021-10",15,""],[2,"i often run into the problem that i already know all the vocabulary an app is trying to teach me, i don't have that problem with this app! however every definition that do i know is wrong and/or unspecific. for example, the word \"complimentary\" has the option \"matching\" marked as correct. as well as the option \"flattering\" marked as incorrect, but it is the most correct definition seeing as complimentary means one thing that compliments another, and compliment is near synonymous with flattery.","2025-01",15,"wrong"],[2,"This app provides a large volume of words but it's frustrating when marking correct answers incorrect because a word has multiple definitions. Words often have multiple definitions and dictionaries will order these definitions based on level of usage, say 1, 2, and 3. This app will present, for example, definitions 2 and 3 but mark only definition 3 correct. I am very grateful for this app in helping me study but the developers should work to correct this error.","2019-09",15,"bug,wrong"],[5,"😍This app is perfect, helps you improve your vocabulary, which are really practical and they don't do stupid easy words like yes, doing and running. Also they give you a really good defenition and example, that' s easy to understand. Helps improve speech and writing, so you can talk like the TED X talks!😂","2021-01",15,"+effect,+short,+exam,+wish"],[1,"I downloaded this app because of the good rating but the app shows incorrect meaning for some words. Such apps should be downloaded from authoratative creators only.","2020-02",14,"wrong"],[3,"Great selection of words, great gradients, great for studying for tests. However, for personal enrichment I would prefer auxilary definitions for each word presented, rather than just the usage expected to be on the test. Also, I would like derivations and slightly elaborated definitions on the backs of cards, and the phonetic spelling of words wouldn't hurt either. Technical vocab or \"beyond gre\" sections would be nice in the future as well.","2019-02",14,"wish,+exam,+wish"],[4,"Pros: It is a productive way to improve one's vocabulary not only for GRE levels but for SAT and Subject tests as well. The algorithm is simple yet effective ane lodges the word in the mind of the learner. Cons: If examples could be given from a vareity of sentences, then a better learning experience could be expected. Also, if words from previous lessons would be included in successive lessons, it would provide a much needed practice. Verdict: ⭐⭐⭐⭐","2019-02",14,"+effect,+short,+exam,+wish"],[5,"This app does an excellent job of vocabulary building. It challenges the player to choose the best word usage amongst other possibilities and uses sentences to illustrate how the word can be used in a sentence. To eliminate the possibility that the player randomly guessed the correct answer, the game is randomized and bring up the same word multiple times with the answer choice in different order.","2020-02",14,"+fun"],[5,"An absolutely must to use app for enhancing your vocabulary, it not only provides meaning with sentence examples but also the pronounciation. A very lucid yet enthralling app which bolstered my vocabulary tellingly, if you err it will repeat the words to aid in memorization. This is a totally candid review. One thing to improve could be only giving words you've learnt when it comes to multiplayer mode (YES IT HAS ONE!) haha i had fun writing this review ^-^","2024-12",14,"+effect,+review,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[4,"Great app. Useful for studying. Only 1 game, but its fun and helpful. Might help if they added different study options like flashcards or make your own sentence or even pneumonic devices. I can do all of those myself so i don't NEED them on the app, but they would be nice features.","2020-09",13,"+effect,+review,+fun,+wish"],[5,"This App will change your approach towards learning yhe words. The App provides a list of Basic, Intermediate and Advanced words. There are several sub levels in each of these major ones. You keep progressing over these levels one after the other. They have a revised pattern as well. so if you choose a word right, you will get the same word again in that specific level just to test your memory. On top of that, you can even compete with othwr online users, indulge in a word battle.","2019-07",12,"+fun,+exam"],[5,"Seriously, it's been about 2 or 3 years since I've touched this app and I have retained most of the terminology from it. Vocabulary Builder is pretty friendly, I see these lessons more as games. It'll take some time, I'll be honest, but don't stress over it. There's nothing to lose whatsoever playing from this.","2020-08",12,"+fun"],[5,"This is super great! Very easy to understand and easy to remember. The definition of the words is great but also the sentences as well. It helps you to understand the words with no problem. I use it at least 3 times a day. I feel like I am addicted to it already. When I am not using it, I am thinking about it. So I think everyone should invest in this tool. I am an adult and still loves it. Never too old to learn new words. Great product!","2020-04",12,"+effect,+short,+fun"],[1,"Yesterday I was at advanced level-4, now it has reset all my study progress. Also all the levels of Basic and Advanced were already completed by me. Now I see none of the levels shows as complete and it is asking me to start from first then only next level will be unlocked. Very disappointed!","2020-09",11,"data"],[3,"A really beautiful app with an user-friendly Interface. But, the only thing that is restricting me from providing a 5 star rating is the lack of more examples for each word and it's Grammatical Usage (Adjective/Adverb..etc) I request you to add that simple feature, which limits us from using these words in an efficient way.","2019-12",11,"ui,+short,+exam"],[4,"A great app for developing vocabs. As it consisyently provides you new as well as previous words for not only to learn but to revise simultaneoulsy. However, i would suggest to provide for a bookmark or starring options so that newely learned words could be directly accessed without need for taking the whole bunch of words in each lesson again.","2020-09",11,"+effect"],[5,"I think that Magoosh is great because of the introduction of learning new words slowly by maximizing our knowledge of the latin root words to find out their definite meaning. It helps greatly for someone wantig to expand their vocabulary by using the Pomodoro technique, in which you set a timer for 25 minutes and focus intensely on the subject at hand. Make sure to be in a room where no distractions are present. May you have a successful study session!","2020-07",10,"+effect,+short"],[5,"I love this app. There are no ads and the vocabulary changes, therefore, Im learning many new words increasing my vocabulary immediately. I have tried another vocabulary app and it lets me get to a certain point and stops and asks me to pay to further my vocabulary skills. This is app is far better. I recommened highly if you'd like to increase your vocabulary skills","2020-04",10,"+free"],[1,"Fails on the most basic level when it can't get the definition of words correct. Started on the basic level to see how the app is and some of the definitions are incorrect (double-checked against dictionaries) . Disappointing.","2024-03",9,"wrong"],[1,"Poor definitions. Knowing a synonym for something is not the same as knowing the definition. And this program is dealing in synonyms. So it is extremely limited as a vocabulary builder. Plus, within using the program for just a few minutes, I found a word that gave the wrong definition.","2020-02",9,"wrong,lack"],[2,"Many, perhaps even most words have poor or ungrammatical definitions that omit or misconstrue the most common ways the word is used. A few definitions and examples are outright wrong. Overall, this app is a bad way to try to learn words.","2023-11",9,""],[4,"A good selection of words to learn from. It would be nice though, if there could be a couple of different example sentences for each word instead of always seeing how the word is used in the same way...I found that it became easier to remember the sentence content than the actual word itself. Other than that, a great app to help boost one's vocabulary.","2020-04",9,"+effect,+exam,+wish"],[5,"This is an amazing app for those who are studying Vocabulary for famous tests, it has a simple yet powerful User interface, words are sperated based on the test you are preparing for, the only thing is missing is a general mechanism so it helps you keep practicing the words you got wrong (like it can be better if u incorporate basic ML algorithms ). Beside that i recommend this app to anyone who is trying to get ready for IELTS or GRE.","2020-04",9,"+effect,+short,+exam"],[5,"I have used Vocabulary Builder for several years now. It is generally pretty good. However, I believe a number of the words are not defined as well as they could be; in other words there are more exact definitions. Often subtleties in meaning are missed.","2021-10",9,""],[1,"All the levels that you have completed again become incomplete and you have to complete them to move again to the next level I am again and again trying to move to the 5th level but I have to again and again do the first and second level. I hate it I am saying it from my experience please never install this app this is a horrific, awful 😞 app. It only helps in making you livid ,and erked. Please do not install it my humble request and advice.","2021-12",8,""],[2,"so far so good but complementary does not mean matching. the opposite actually, it means two (or more) things that are distinctly different but work well together. wish there was a way to report incorrect definitions/synonyms edit- i have become unable to trust the synonyms provided, leading to disuse of the app. not to mention how most words are either standard or so obscure they are practically unusual","2022-08",8,"wrong,wish"],[4,"The app is good in the fact that it allows me to know more words and relearn older words. Sometimes it's a word that I think I know but then it means something entirely different. Though I feel, for the future versions, they could have a feature wherein the users could use the words they learn in sentences of their own so that they learn better and faster and that too they know how to use the words they have just learnt, that is, in what context and in what way. Thank you for this beautiful app!","2022-10",8,""],[4,"This app is awesome for learning new vocab words. The feature where you can play others in a match is also quite fun if you want to test out your skills. The only problems I have with this app is that the parts of speech for each vocab word isn't given when learning it and the lack of a review for all the vocab you've studied already. These problems don't interfere with learning, but it would make it much better with these improvements. Besides that, I like the app and I'm learning quickly.","2019-07",8,"+short,+review,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Best vocabulary app I recommend all of the vocabulary builders to install it. The best thing in this app is that it's free from adds and is for all levels of English students. One more thing I liked in it is it Doesn't let you go to another level until you score all words correctly it also repeats the questions you marked wrong very much helpful. Thank you so much","2020-09",8,"+effect,+free"],[4,"Great way to exercise your brain! I have a degenerative disease that effects my brain, and this app helps me stay sharp! My only complaints are that the graphics are pretty basic and some of the examples are a little political, biased, or unclear. It would be helpful to have multiple sentences for examples if one answers incorrectly multiple times as well as context for the vocabulary that is used more than once, but has different meanings. Other than that it is a great app!","2019-05",7,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"Super simple and does exactly what I need it to do, no obnoxious ads or gamification, always provides an example sentence, provides a wide array of words and purposefully includes similar-sounding or similar-meaning options on occasion to prevent you from guessing your way through it. Doesn't punish you for mistakes or set your lesson back except to make you review the word a few more times, which I greatly appreciate because sometimes I just want to learn rather than play something. Good app!","2026-08",7,"+short,+review,+exam"],[5,"This app is one of the best app of its kind. The best part is the platform show the wrongly selected words repeatedly so that it could be corrected. Moreover on the basis of your performance the words level gets updated to easy, moderate and hard. The one thing which could be added is the images In each word to get them stored in mind and recalls them when Needed...","2021-07",7,"+short"],[5,"Learning vocabulary is veritably taxing! But this is what makes your onerous journey to vocab-study enjoyable. It comprises more than 1000 words that appear quite pellucid being used in sentence. I've been using it for long and just got avidly enamored of it. Moreover, its 'Quizz with random partner' tremendously attracts me. I'd recommend using it with a Magoosh account for saving your progress.","2022-01",7,"+fun"],[1,"Uses uncommon definitions for words without giving an example of the way they're being used. Causes a lot of frustration when you know the word but they don't have anything except an extremely obscure definition.","2020-09",6,""],[3,"Some words that have more than one meaning, have multiple correct definitions included in the answer choices. So you may select a correct definition but the app tells you it is incorrect. This could be confusing and misleading to a novice learner like me. The app should at least include some more precision such as what part of speech the word represents.","2018-10",6,"wrong,voice,ui"],[3,"this app is one of the best. Learning new words is simple and I can easily improve my vocabulary. However sometimes I don't find it helpful especially since there is no option to see a word's part of speech. (Nouns, adjectives, verbs, etc.)","2020-05",6,"voice,wish,+effect,+short,+wish"],[5,"The joy in playing this game not only allows us to learn new vocab but also gives us the exam feel while answering each question (That helps in remembering for longer period). I am so excited to learn new words which in fact gives an added advantage in setting right tone for listeners of my friends circle.","2020-02",6,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[5,"The best app for improving vocabulary. Suitable for all age groups. The repetition of words help the user to memorize the words easily. The best thing is it does not show irritated adds which makes the learning more enjoyable. Highly recommended !!!","2024-03",6,"+effect,+review,+fun"],[5,"Absolutely love this app! I needed to prep for my TEP as the first step of becoming an interpreter. This really helped. Plus I could use it anytime and anywhere to study..with friends, doctor office, at home, it was so great to have this as another way to quiz myself. I still use it from time to time just to refresh on words that you never know may come up while interpreting. Please keep this free and available for others who are seeking to improve their vocab or preparing for a test. Thanks","2022-02",6,"+effect,+exam,+free,+wish"],[5,"Yeahh.....I can say undoubtedly it's really helpful app to become advanced in vocab. There is one spl feature which I love mostly in this app is...repeating of those vocabs which we r not able to find the ans it's the process of revising vocabs...so that we can remember atleast few...😁yeah most productive app.......","2020-06",6,"+effect"],[5,"one of the best apps for vocabulary that you could ask for. even if you are not preparing for any exams this could help you increase your linguistic skills. the beauty of the app is not only in the number of new words but lies in the usage of the learned vocabulary with quality sentences and exaples which is given here. A great app indeed","2019-06",6,"+effect,+exam"],[1,"Never saves where I left off!! I'll go back in the app and it will say I haven't completed levels that I've already done, the progress just goes down to like 2/40 words.","2023-09",5,""],[1,"A very dumb app! I have completed the beginner levels and have reached the intermediate one but one day, it suddenly showed all levels locked. It is compulsing me to start from the beginning. Very dirty app.","2020-02",5,""],[1,"It somehow reset my current progress and I have to do everything from the beginning. So frustrating!!!!","2019-07",5,"data"],[1,"The app stops by itself. Unable to study for over a week. When will you fix it?","2023-09",5,""],[1,"Since the last update the app crashes and logs me out each time I use it","2023-09",5,"bug"],[2,"There's a lot of easily available information like synonyms, antonyms connotations that can easily be added to the flashcards to make it more useful and easier to learn. The short definitions of a word don't help a lot with making connections in the mind to be able to retain that information.","2019-08",5,""],[3,"I like everything about this except one thing. Often, the provided correct answer is not the definition of the word. For example, it said the definition of \"lethargic\" is \"weary.\" Maybe they're trying to simulate how the SAT wants you to choose the \"best\" of the available answers, but some of these are so far off. I'm just an adult trying to expand my vocabulary.","2025-05",5,"+exam"],[5,"It's really useful and it helps me to learn many different worlds and memories them in a very short time. But it can be perfect if it adds some texts or short stories which include the words that we learned so we can memories words even easier. Thanks for this wonderful app","2020-04",5,"+effect,+short"],[5,"This app is so helpful! Helps you memorize and build your vocab in no time at all. The interactive user friendly interface and quizzes ,the smart score tracker is highly efficient. I would recommend the developers to use a wider range of vocab ,both higher and lower level to help learners","2022-06",5,"+effect"],[5,"I am really enjoying this app that expands my vocabulary by introducing new words in levels. It was introduced to me by a paralegal that requires a vast vocabulary in her profession. I like the way this program repeats a term I've missed shortly afterwards that it goes beyond my encoding level of memory to my storage level.","2020-04",5,"+short,+fun"],[5,"This app is very helpful, I can improve my vocabulary, I use all days only 15 min.. and I can say that this app is a important learning tool if you really want to gain and retain more words, since these words go out automatically when you practice your speaking .. thanks to the creators..","2020-08",5,"+effect,+wish"],[1,"Would be better if the words you get wrong are moved into a different section, so you can practice. Instead, each level makes you repeat words you've already mastered, over and over, until the deck finally loops back around to the word you've been struggling with.","2024-10",4,"repeat"],[1,"5mins into app, answering all questions correctly and I can't progress I'm stuck on 19/20 as it just repeats the same 5 words or so, even though I've answered them correctly at least a dozen times each.","2021-10",4,"bug,repeat"],[1,"The problem occurred when I had to choose a definition for the word \"complimentary\" and either I choose \"free\" or \"flattering\", my answer was labeled \"INCORRECT\". Needs improvement.","2020-08",4,"wrong,wish"],[1,"I'm just wondering why GRE vocabulary builder apps needs to have full access to our phone media and filed?!!?!?!?","2019-07",4,""],[2,"I was enjoying it and actually benefiting from it A LOT. Until all my data was erased and everything I've worked on went to waste for no reason. When it happened the first time i thought i had done sth wrong but it happened again and again until i decided to delete it and find another app, unfortunately. I honestly loved this app and it had actually made me improve my vocabulary skills.","2022-04",4,"wish"],[2,"Incorrect word definitions. Started using this app to build my vocabulary and I noticed that some of the words such as \"gleaned\" and \"facetious\" had definitions that really do not corroborate with notable dictionaries. Often these more complex words do not have direct synonyms and this apps' attempt to define words through synonyms alone is misleading.","2020-11",4,"wrong"],[2,"Words can mean more than one thing - complimentary can be \"given free, no charge\" or \"resembling a compliment.\" This app will present both correct answers as a choice, but will only accept one answer as correct. So I know I don't want this app to teach me word meanings, I might become very narrowminded","2023-10",4,""],[2,"The app is beautiful and user friendly however sometimes definitions are not precisely matched with the entries. On the other hand, mostly definitions and examples are more complex than entries and not well-designed for education.","2021-06",4,"ui"],[2,"Like the interface, skill advancement, etc. However, some of the definitions are misleading or just plain wrong. When the app claimed \"check\" to be synonymous with \"refrain from doing\" it honestly made me wonder if it's all computer generated","2021-09",4,"ui"],[3,"There are a few errors. I selected synonym for \"betray\" as \"deceive\". And it was marked wrong and the correct answer was shown \"reveal\" which is no where even close to the meaning. This is a basic word. Don't make mistakes of this level.","2018-09",4,"bug,wrong"],[4,"I had to make an account to be able to saved my score so its 4 stars! I'd love to sort of modify the length of sentence because somehow it's too short & I precisely realize that I'm just memorizeg big words which is ineffective for acquiring fluency, I need patterns of constructing sentences to develop my style! The sentence exhale should have a story so we're not gonna be bored! Recommend the app!","2021-03",4,"+effect,+short,+wish"],[4,"I would have given a 5 star If you have a button to mark certain new words we have learn so that we can recall and If antonyms are also use in the sentences to a possible extent I think it will be more effective as learning app. Indeed I don't like the app, I love it. well done.👍","2019-06",4,"+effect"],[5,"There is a gradual increase of difficulty level which is perfectly suitable for beginners. Though the levels would have been more challenging if the answering format was time limited. Overall, it is a nice platform for non-native English speakers like me to keep in touch with the language.","2019-10",4,""],[1,"Screen Reader can no longer identify or select any buttons or most items. I had no problems before the most recent update, but I'm visually impaired and can't use the app anymore. Otherwise, this app is fun and I would give it 5 stars.","2019-10",3,"ui"],[1,"I sync the data in app setting, but after syncing i lost my all progress, now i started again from level 1,that is too disapointing for me. Please improve in your app development.Btw it's an awsome for learning vocabulary","2019-06",3,"data,wish"],[1,"Great concept however a huge bug other users have encountered also. My progress gets wiped after 4 or 5 levels even though I've signed in. Will be uninstalling and finding a different app. Had deterred me from purchasing it.","2023-10",3,"bug"],[1,"not sure who made this but common words section is filled with mistakes. they need to put in effort in identifying what words mean and not just assume its meaning, youre teaching people a new language, you cant just teach them inaccurate things as youre just wasting their time learning things that are incorrect.","2024-09",3,"wrong"],[1,"This app distorts and misrepresents the meaning of the English words it quizzes you on, and gives examples of contemporary uses of such to justify such distorted meanings. It treats someone's modern incorrect use of a word as authoritative regarding its definition, and from this position then distorts its meaning even further. While using this app for a few days, it became evident that it is often not accurate apropos English words and the meanings thereof. I would not recommend this app.","2024-10",3,"wrong"],[1,"It automatically reset my progress all the time. When it happened for the first time, I thought I can do again just as a review. But it happens again and again. Please fix..","2020-08",3,"data,wish"],[1,"Sometimes the definitions provided are so strange.For example it says presumptuous means overly forward. Actually, there are many better words to define presumptuous.let's see another word: inure. Which dictionary does define inure as harden to?Though this definition is accurate, It could simply define it as to get used to sth difficult or unpleasant. Another example I see today: miser:one who is cheap!That is really improper. I suggest that Magoosh revise the incorrect definions ASAP","2019-11",3,"wrong"],[2,"App not loading after opening, just the white screen. I have used this app in the past. I downloaded it again but this time its showing an error. It is being detected as a game in my mobile for some weird reason I don't know why.","2019-06",3,"bug"],[2,"the interface is extremely bad, why do i have to login every single time when i open the app after a while, this is extremely frustrating, please fix this mess","2023-10",3,"data,ui,wish"],[2,"Impressive that provided different sets of words for different tests. But doesn't save progress even after I signed in.","2023-11",3,""],[3,"Progress is reset after 3-4 days even when I'm using the app regularly. Very frustrating since i have to begin all over again and can't access the higher levels until the lower ones are unlocked.","2019-06",3,"data"],[4,"App is good but need more features as well as better GUI. Also it should ask you to recall words/definition out of memory using something like flashcards because recognizing a similar meaning word when it's shown doesn't necessarily mean you've memorized it by heart. If the devs add these features, I'd rate it 5.","2023-02",3,"+effect,+review"],[4,"The app is lucid in the objective. Especially, I love the quiz part where you can play with anyone out there and whet your skills. A small advice to include some pictures describing words with synonyms. Moreover, the sentences can be made a little easy to understand. Thanks!","2019-08",3,"+short"],[4,"It's a very useful app. One of the best i have come across for vocabulary building. Totally recommend. The words get harder as you pass the levels and whenever you get any word wrong, it make sure you won't get it wrong again.","2019-06",3,""],[5,"I've been using this app for a while now and I love the repetitive nature of learning new words. If you don't know a word it really does its best to make sure you really get a grasp of the word until you get it right multiple times before you progress any more to go onto the next round. For me it's the best word learning app I've come across out of any others I've tried.","2022-11",3,""],[5,"It is almost next to impossible to find a good app to master your skills. Finally, I found one. I really lije the words and the eay the app help you to memorize them. The only minus is that sometimes the definition is not clear and I feel like a would really appreciate to see more examples.","2019-02",3,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"I requested a vocabulary book at my college language center and they recommended this application. I have no regrets, my favorite part is it doesn't give you a definition when you get a word wrong but they use it in a sentence instead. If they wanted to improve I'll add a dictionary option or a short definition when the word is answered wrong. But I like this app and it's design all together.","2018-12",3,"+short,+wish"],[5,"It offers you a large number of words to learn, which are useful for exams and your daily life. The app not only gives you the meaning of the word but also teaches you how to use the words in the right contexts. Because knowing merely the meaning isn't enough. You need to know when and where to apply your knowledge. It helps you with that. Learning through repition. Words that you get wrong reappear just enough times to engrave the words in your brain.","2020-05",3,"+effect,+exam,+habit"],[5,"The app is greatly helpful, you can hear all the unfamiliar words pronounced and you also have them in the context so it's easier to memorize them. The benefits also apply for cases when the synonymic expression might not ring a bell either.","2022-05",3,"+effect"],[1,"About 10% of words are incorrect or misleading, like conflict: answer \"to be impossible with\". Collins english dict. Says it means to have a disgreement or argument with, not be impossible with. Many other examples lead me to think the author is not a native english speaker, avoid this app sorry.","2024-12",2,"wrong"],[1,"I had paid to get more access in the app for words. I had been using it until it asked me to create an account and I did. Now it's showing all the words I paid for as \"locked\". What the hell should I do???","2020-06",2,"data"],[1,"Great name, but thats it. This app is a total waste of time- garbage. It took all of 15 minutes for me to find numerous errors. It says it is for GRE prep, but clearly the makers of this app use English as a second language.","2019-06",2,"bug"],[1,"In it's attempt to be brief, this app misses proper definitions of many words. It's not just useless, it will actually hurt your understanding.","2019-11",2,""],[1,"Lot of vocab is quite misleading and not even related. Uninstalling this and prolly install again after this MAJOR bug is fixed. The functionality of the app is great though. But kills the primary purpose of this app.","2022-02",2,"bug"],[1,"THERE IS ALOT OF WORDS WITH DIFFICULT MEANING!!!! I mean they gave us the meaning of all words but, i cant understand it. is very complex meaning pls make sure you make a easiest sentences So we can understand batter. i will uninstall this app back and i will reinstall it till you fix this problem!! is such a bad app to understand the meaning of the words","2021-07",2,""],[1,"The idea of developing App is good but content is not good . Sometimes it has not exact meaning the word I look. it has a similiar word .. very bad..","2019-10",2,""],[1,"Misleading or straight up incorrect definitions of the vocabulary Quite disappointing considering the app itself is nice and simple to use","2024-03",2,"wrong"],[1,"It's nice but it doesn't excersize your mind by trying your comprehension and grammar","2026-04",2,""],[1,"The data keeps getting erased, so i have to start over every time i want to play zzzz","2018-11",2,""],[1,"One of the sentences used for a word was discriminatory towards a group of people for their beliefs. Massive thumbs down for that. Uninstalled for pushing an agenda that should be kept out of educational games such as this.","2018-11",2,""],[2,"Eh was really enjoying my time and was very accepting of my mistakes but then things started becoming more unreasonable. I had to use google and guess what. There was no specification, that's the least you could do if it's verb, adjective, etc. it would make a difference. I'm glad I wasn't the only one who found it absurd. I gave it another star for helping me realize you can use the same word in a different sense so thank you for that.","2024-05",2,"wrong,repeat"],[2,"It's a good app, that is great for making you practice and learn words, although sometimes it's too heavy in the practicing aspect as it keeps deleting your progress. Very frustrating to deal with. It started a little while after doing a \"multiplayer\" match.","2019-12",2,""],[2,"The words need context, because most words have different meanings/definitions. Also, some of the definitions are incorrect and I am not sure how learning incorrect definitions is going to improve my vocabulary. Lastly, I am unable to sign up using Google or Facebook.","2021-12",2,"wrong,wish"],[2,"I loved the app, but my progress is regularly erased. I also signed in to save my progress, but the progress is again gone; returning me to the beginning. Is that a bug?","2019-09",2,"bug"],[3,"The word list is good but some additional changes should be done in order to augment retaining capacity such as introducing mnemonics to remember the word or building flashcards to showcase meaning so as to guess the actual word. Also, writing capability should also be in-built since it helps words to retain better and at the same time avoid misspell.","2020-04",2,"+effect,+review"],[3,"Please change the wrong options in the second round in the word review section so that we can recognize the correct grammar when browsing among new words. And the second suggestion: In the review sections, it is better to use new sentences from the word used. Let's see and understand the true meaning","2020-04",2,"+review"],[3,"Hi It's better in which this app divide any level to only 10 words not to 10-20-30-40 ... 65 For instance it's better divide 40 words to 4 stages of 10 words then after completing the first 10 words app run to next ten words... In my opinion if you do the above explanation your app will be the best in it's sort. Thank you so much for your pursuing.","2019-11",2,""],[4,"The app is good but can be best. For example, they can categorize words into a single group for words belonginf to the same family. Furthermore, like previous apps they dont provide wprds with multiple meanings. I hope they make it better soon. Anyways, its good but not as good as it can be","2018-10",2,"+exam,+wish"],[4,"It helps to review the initial words and and is strongly recommended if you meet the ceiling on word memory, just try for one section and see how you feel and the result. I do love the example sentences, they not only assist to understand, but also bring me the writing materials. Good luck!","2018-12",2,"+effect,+review,+exam"],[4,"this game is helping me expand my limited vocabulary, I just came back from a foreign country and feel that my grammar level in English has plummeted. BUT thanks to this app I feel more confident in my ability to communicate effectively with a large variety of people. I would like if the voice pronouncing the words weren't so robotic though...","2019-07",2,"+effect,+fun"],[4,"This is a great app to introduce new words into your life. Only reason I didn't give 5 stars is because I would like to see the definition and an example provided when you get the answer wrong to ensure you understand your mistake fully and can help you learn the correct meaning.","2024-02",2,"+exam"],[5,"I love building my vocabulary and this app has definitely helped. I sometimes go back on my own to practice levels that I have surpassed, and the app does it for you as well sometimes when you select the incorrect meaning of a word; allowing you to try again and absorb the correct meaning of each word in each level. Try it and practice your vocabulary with friends. #notsponsored","2019-07",2,"+effect"],[5,"I have played word games in an effort to increase my knowledge of the spelling and meaning of words in the English language but this is by far a more advanced and powerful learning tool. It's like a game but the corollary effects are astounding. I though I wanted to learn Spanish but I now realize, I need to learn English first! Great App!!!","2019-07",2,"+fun"],[5,"This app really released my tension regarding my CSS ( central Superior Services) vocabulary. It was difficult for me to study vocabulary from book on daily basis as it was time-taking. After getting this app, I am able to study effectively in short time and it's very easy to use and get yourself assessed. Suggestion for app developer. Kindly add more words of GRE. And make all your vocabulary app with Mcqs practice it helps alot in learning and memorizing words. Suhail AhmedDys from Pakistan.","2020-04",2,"+effect,+short,+exam,+habit"],[5,"Great word list with easy, modrate & difficult levels. Very good for gre verbal section. The words are in quiz form so you have 4 options and you choose from it and if you get wrong than they ask again and revice the whole word list. There is also ielts and toefl word list included in this app.","2019-06",2,"+short,+exam"],[5,"An amazing app. Highly effective & efficient to increase vocabulary skill. Easy to memorize for repeating those wrong chosen words more than 3 times. The difficulty level increases gradually step by step. It also includes sentence using those vocabs which makes the way easier to understand the meaning & to learn by heart.","2022-09",2,"+effect,+short"],[1,"Many of the definitions are unhelpful or misleading at best. For instance, the app says begrudge means to envy but in the example sentence it means allow reluctantly, not envy.","2022-10",1,""],[1,"can't create an account. It keeps saying not a correct password when i am actually opening a new account there. Had already tried all complex combinations for password but a failure.","2019-04",1,"data"],[1,"Number one झटू application. Don't install it. No progress in test list. By many times of updation . Does not preforms well","2020-11",1,""],[1,"When I am practicing rc passages, I always find the need to look for the word whose meaning I do not know. But i have to go through entire flashcards to see the meaning of that one word.. This is very time consuming.. Please make the list of all the word for once","2019-09",1,""],[1,"They give you a word without context, and then ask you what it means. A word can clearly mean multiple things but they only offer one word and 4 potential synonyms. Terrible way to bolster your English skills.","2021-06",1,""],[1,"The first time the app injected political bias into the definition of a word I thought it may simply be my own perception. Then, 5 or more partisan definitions later I realized that this app is simple indoctrination.","2018-10",1,""],[1,"The only thing worse than not knowing a word is learning the incorrect definition. Unfortunately, I encountered this exact problem within the first 30 seconds of using this app.","2025-04",1,"wrong"],[1,"Got quite far through one module, and I logged in today to see all my progress has disappeared. I won't be starting again.","2019-10",1,"bug"],[1,"What happened to this app? My previous progress has been erased and the app no longer maintains your completion once you exit. Please fix!","2023-10",1,"wish"],[1,"Lost all my progress randomly. Some words don't have correct explaination or the explanation isnt descriptive","2021-05",1,""],[1,"Time wasting app. It will really get on your nerves cause theyre gonna make you learn the same word for about a 1000 times.","2021-03",1,"repeat"],[1,"it's very useful app there is learn similar words and new words .it's just like a game whenever i get free time i played this game it's app built my vocabulary great","2018-12",1,""],[1,"Requires registration and installation of additional apps","2021-08",1,""],[1,"Misinformation with options, bad app","2025-10",1,""],[2,"Skip this one. Each word provided says to \"select the best definition\". Whoever wrote this app, doesn't understand all the various uses for the words they have selected. It's fairly limited to the app creator's basic understanding of certain words. There's better apps out there for vocabulary.","2023-08",1,"lack"],[2,"Not that great I've hit the correct answer at least 8 times on a word and it keeps saying I got it right. Even if I picked a different option it kept saying I would click a word I'm not even close to touching.","2022-06",1,""],[2,"It'll teach you a few new words, but the core game loop asks you to select a single synnonym from a liat, and often their choice seems limited or tangential to a common reading.","2021-06",1,"lack"],[2,"Aside the fact that this app holds promises, I find it to be persistently frustrating. Why do I keep losing my progress? What's the point in studying, if you'll end up starting again?","2020-06",1,""],[2,"I don't see a place in the app to submit a bug report, so this will have to do. \"Factitious\" is not a word. \"Fictitious\" is what I assume was supposed to be there, given the definition given in the app.","2018-10",1,"bug"],[2,"I had a really bad experience when the app kept on hurling the same words over and over again and there was no end to repetition in a particular level.","2020-03",1,"repeat"],[2,"Keeps repeating the same correct questions , which is very frustrating . When you almost trying to finish a level but you can't ,10-15 repeats is here to annoy the f*** out of you .","2020-05",1,"repeat"],[2,"I'll recommend this app for almost every student. It helps one to master his or her vocabulary and polishes your speech","2021-03",1,"voice"],[2,"there is a login issue, the log in page refreshes and comes back to the same login page. the main problem is my progress is not showing until i login","2023-09",1,"data"],[3,"I havent noticed any bugs or glitches or ads, overall good experience. but I would like to see sentences added when asked to match the best description of the word. Also would like to see other ways to help remember the words other than the same multiple type questions.","2020-04",1,"ad,bug,+effect"],[3,"The app is good but it just makes you memeorize the word. Only one synonym and a sentence as an example does not justify the essence of that word while actually using it with the right kind of situation. I tend to not get acquainted to words from this app as much as I get from the words which I have seen in dictionary or searched pg Google. Thanks.","2019-10",1,"+exam"],[4,"I'm not a native English speaker. Even though I speak well, sometimes I lack vocabulary knowledge. I'm gonna make up for that in this app! It has helped me a lot already. EDIT: I believe this app lacks something important. Context is needed to determine the meaning of a word. It's the reason I don't know many meanings, and including the phrase containing the word before choosing an answer would be helpful.","2024-05",1,"+effect"],[4,"Actually I think this app is better than the IELTS flashcards app and has a better and more intuitive user interface. The meaning definitions in this app are brief and concise and makes me more confident in expanding my vocabulary. I also wanted to suggest that it would be a nice thing if illustrative figures where available for some of the advanced words, so that they could help learners. I hope the developers use my feedback to bring further improvements to this app.","2025-11",1,"+review,+exam,+wish"],[4,"It's a good app that is easy to use and helpful in learning new words just wish you could do a mode where it throws words of varying difficulty at you and you have 3 different lives or something of that sort and once you get to a certain point and win it'll give you a score of sorts just something simple like that","2023-01",1,"+effect,+short,+wish"],[4,"Have learned and reviewed new words for me to use in my vocabulary, there is no ads, is pretty easy to use and simple, something I would like to see is if there is a way to slow down the speed of the voices to make it easy to follow the pronunciation. Nice product.","2022-05",1,"+effect,+short,+review,+listen,+free"],[4,"It's a good app, to learn vocabulary in a short time, and in brief, and without feeling bored. There are MCQ type questions to choose the correct meaning from, and the word meanings are provided in short phrases with single sentence examples.","2023-07",1,"+short,+exam"],[5,"This app is lots of fun andd easy to use, AND is has helped me improve my spelling and expand my vocabulary. I work at it by paying attention to the spelling of words I don't know and read the examples given of the word in context. This helps me remember the word. I then translate this into Spanish and it helps me in both languages. Love it.","2019-01",1,"+effect,+short,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Vocabular Builder is an excellent app for building our vocabulary. It is base on basic, intermediate and advanced level of Gre, GMAT, Ielts, Toefl and Collocation flashcards etc. But it needs a little more features: 1- It does not pronounce the words offline. 2- It does not have the meaning of words in target language for example Persian meaning. Instead of this, it has a lot of synonym words.","2022-07",1,"+review,+exam"],[5,"This app offers a profuse abundance to one's vocabulary prowess. Even if an individual has but a modicum of time available, you will exponentially increase your ability to converse in the outter and boundless regions of the English language. In fact, I can't believe how I'm talking at this very moment. Hitherto this day, I would have no idea what any of this meant. Now, such words just seemed utterly facile to me. 😀","2023-02",1,""],[5,"Most standardized test like the GRE/GMAT and TOEFL come with questions that will require you to have a broad knowledge of English vocabulary to give the best possible answers to question , this magoosh vocabulary builder is precisely what I needed to learn the most frequent words on the GRE in a short time and I don't need to carry a notebook to cram a list of words , the app will teach you thesame new word several times till you get it right even my daily conversation skills are far better","2024-10",1,"+short,+exam,+habit"],[5,"helps review words, the sample sentence are esp. helpful for understand the meaning, which in turn helps to memorize words. Review over and over in the seemingly sporadic, but in fact is based on the weaknesses in words recognition. I hope to do well in GRE test next April.","2018-12",1,"+effect,+review,+exam,+wish"],[5,"From the time I started using this app, I am really amazed to see an 'anomaly' in my vocab learning process. It worked like a 'catalyst' in transforming my vocab. I really feel 'mesmerized' while learing vocabs in the app. It feels amazing. (words learnt from lesson one :P)","2022-08",1,""],[5,"English is my second language. The big challenge is always using the right word in the right concept. The vocabulary builder app helps me tremendously by showing each word in a sentence. I learn the meaning and the difference between similar words.","2018-10",1,"+effect"],[1,"Not useful. Needs a lot of work. There should be a feature to pronounce the words before you take the test and use it in a sentence. I got a word wrong, but it was confusing because there are two definitions for the same word. The word was 'appropriate' If they had used it in a sentence I would've gotten it right.","2022-07",0,"repeat,ui"],[1,"It repeats words and seems like it is targeted toward a large demographic of uneducated people. Don't look to this app if you want a constant barrage of stimulating words. Look at a classical dictionary. Let me know if you find an app that has a plethora of words I am looking for in a gaming environment.","2020-09",0,"repeat"],[1,"meh, would be more effective if the app implemented a feature where you didn't see the options so you could actually utilize active recall techniques. also, defenitions are underwhelming and broad","2023-01",0,""],[1,"I played the beginner rounds and figured some words in the quizzes have been given incorrect meanings. Hence, won't be continuing with this app.","2021-05",0,"bug,wrong"],[1,"It has been a nice experience for me to solve vocab from this app. No doubt, it has worked wonders for me will aslo stand in good stead, I hope. Such app must be made, updated and shared in order to provide knowledge to the youth as well as other generation.","2022-06",0,"wish"],[1,"It could use practical tests to excersize the brain to better build up and strengthen vocabulary and how to construct more advanced English sentences","2024-05",0,""],[1,"In GRE/GMAT section, Basic level 5 is not getting completed. Still 1 word is pending even after so many correct attempts.","2019-02",0,""],[1,"Progressions are automatically deleted after some days, then I've to repeat from the beginning. Really frustrating!","2020-04",0,"repeat"],[1,"Stupid app ...wastes unnecessary time in navigating easy words, no dedicated list of words. Just waste time in playing their badly assorted quizzes","2020-05",0,""],[1,"The mcqs are awful most times the words have multiple right answers and no context to choose the most right answer like in SAT.","2021-06",0,""],[1,"Was using this App to learn vocabulary, until the next level is freezed, completed intermediate words for gre level 4 but level 5 wont get unlocked.","2019-04",0,"bug"],[1,"Gives the most basic words in the world. Of course, ielts wouldn't ask such trash questions. I don't know why does this app have 5M+ downloads. It's not for entrance preparation, it's for those who don't even know the V of Vocabulary.","2020-04",0,""],[1,"I cannot log in or even create an account. it does accept my password. I tried a zillion times.","2019-07",0,"data"],[1,"Where is the app icon! I have to open the app through Google play store because the app doesn't show up on my app list!","2019-01",0,""],[1,"To many bugs making users uncomfortable to use the app. Fix them as soon as possible Technical Team","2023-10",0,"bug"],[1,"worst app, progress not syncing plz fix this issue as soon as possible.","2026-07",0,"data"],[1,"Not getting a full screen view. Only half screen.. maybe not optimized for notch display.","2019-02",0,""],[1,"This app is quite good, have good system, help to learn vocabulary in a proper way.","2023-07",0,""],[1,"When l finish a level and then close the app it makes me start from the beginning again!","2022-10",0,""],[1,"Why it always shows pending man!!!! Previously, it goes up to 70 percent, then automatically stopped","2023-09",0,""],[1,"This is one of the best vocabulary builder app, no doubts about that. You'll should definitely give it a try!","2019-10",0,""],[1,"After downloading not showing in menu. Have to open playstore to open the app","2022-12",0,"bug"],[1,"This app literally needs improvement A lot of words are defined incorrectly!","2020-09",0,"wrong,wish"],[1,"App would repeatedly crash and act like like i selected a different choice then i did","2022-07",0,"bug,repeat"],[1,"Super buggy in how it deals with saving progress and logging in","2023-11",0,"bug"],[1,"Intermediate 4, has 39 questions! It's a bug which made the app useless!","2019-11",0,"bug"],[1,"Lot of ads .. horrible .. Do not use this app. you wont get any benefit.","2019-04",0,"ad,bug"],[1,"Its showing incorrect meaning..appropriate showing forcefully","2022-03",0,"wrong"],[1,"Poor app. I gave test but after 4- 5 test the test has been locked again only first test in unlocked","2020-05",0,""],[1,"Great app for practicing vocabulary.","2024-11",0,""],[1,"I am not able to access level 5 of intermediate gre words","2019-10",0,""],[1,"Perfect for gre preparation and vocabulary learning","2021-11",0,""],[1,"The pronunciation is off.","2019-10",0,"voice"],[1,"Very cooperative and interested app.","2024-07",0,""],[1,"There need to be bookmark feature to save the flashcard I like.","2021-08",0,""],[1,"It is only in English, it would have been better if you understood it in Hindi.","2025-01",0,""],[1,"İ reached level 3 , now automatically they signed out me, i can not sign in 😐","2023-10",0,"data"],[1,"The title doesn't seem to fit the content in the app.","2022-12",0,""],[1,"Ok. I've played for less than 10 minutes. So far this game has gotten two definitions wrong?! What?! How can someone who doesn't know better learn what's what!? Deleted.","2020-04",0,""],[2,"It has some vocab. But not really helpful enough for IELTS or any exams. Also can complete it pretty fast. Even the hard words were really easy.","2026-09",0,""],[2,"It's an amazing application by for learning words. However, I need a search option where I can go to specific words that I've learnt, whenever I need. I can't go back to repeating 50-60 words to look for one meaning. So please add it, It'll be amazingly helpful.","2019-05",0,"repeat,wish"],[2,"The groups of words get bigger and bigger as you progress. This makes it very difficult to get the repetition necessary to solidify the new words long term. Other than this good app.","2023-08",0,""],[2,"(You got this wrong last time) gets displayed over and over and over. Point out when I'm wrong immediately after I'm wrong. There is zero POSITIVE reason to keep stating (You got this wrong last time), unless i just got it wrong.","2026-09",0,""],[2,"Honestly, it would be better if the app gave sentence examples when making you guess. Sometimes works have multiple meanings and both meanings are options to pick from, but context is a huge clue.","2019-04",0,""],[2,"This app is good for vocab but unexpectedly causes my phone to restart while using it. It has happened four times while using the app and no other time outside of that.","2019-03",0,""],[2,"I don't know why but my progress is not saved by app and i have to go through all levels again and again. This is not expected from such otherwise great app..","2022-07",0,""],[2,"It might be good for beginner English learners but it is too easy for intermediate English speakers.","2021-05",0,""],[2,"Great exercise game. Erases my progress. No point in playing if everytime I make headway I have to start from the beginning everytime in order to learn new words.","2019-11",0,""],[2,"The way you learn the words is pretty fun and effective. The online games suck though. The way the game rules work just suck and it's no fun.","2025-07",0,""],[2,"I used this app pretty regularly. The definitions are not intuitive nor common. It might do more harm than good.","2020-12",0,""],[2,"nice app. But it would be better to show definitions of words too. A similar word + 1 example are not enough for understanding the meanings","2019-02",0,"lack"],[2,"Meaning of some of the words provided by the app is not really accurate, say for example : 1) Meaning by the app - egotist - boaster ; 2) Original meaning - egotist - a person who is excessively conceited or absorbed in themselves; self-seeker.","2021-12",0,""],[2,"Okay aap , but not so good . This is excellent that they gave a word many times. But I was already boared . And next level does not open. I thought all over this is so bad 😔.","2022-11",0,""],[2,"Needs longer descriptions. Close synonyms often don't carry the full meaning of the word. Could lead to poor understanding of certain words.","2020-03",0,""],[2,"Even the hard words option has the easiest words to learn for IELTS and TOEFL","2020-08",0,""],[2,"I will add 3 more stars if you add bookmarks to every vocabs and More defintion of every word in a different context ...","2021-11",0,""],[3,"When a person give GMAT exam, he face lot of hard words, few words are there in this app, but not all words. But you should include enough words from different books so that if a person can refer this app he can easily clear GMAT exam without need to read different books, newspapers and other materials. I am not saying that this app is not good. this really good but few more things need to add","2025-04",0,"lack,+exam"],[3,"I've been getting a few multiple choice questions without the right answer, then told the right answer (which wasn't in the question) so the tracking gets unreliable, kindly fix? Otherwise really enjoy the app! :) 🙌🏾","2025-03",0,"+fun"],[3,"I really enjoy this app but cannot proceed any further as on level two under General Words for GRE, it is not recognizing I have completed all the words and will not allow me to go to the next level. I've answered the review questions over a 100 times hoping it will eventually let me move on but it won't. Hoping for a fix.","2022-10",0,"bug,+review,+fun,+exam"],[3,"Make more mnemonic! Other critical reviewers said it perfectly. Bookmark/fav list. Bigger words. Definitions restrictive and don't accommodate words with multiple meanings. (I want to practice my International Art English style words. Look it up- it's hyuuge and very useful for any graduate humanities). Agree w/others: need more synonyms etc. Make this for logophiles not just GRE peeps. Speaking of Intl. Art Eng., make quizzes of words from different fields! LegaL =/= CRT =/= Lit =/= Humanities","2022-04",0,"lack,+review,+exam"],[3,"Although the app is good but it automatically clears all my progress and I have to pass all the level again and again . I don't know it is a technical fault or something else but I suggest the team to fix this problem asap.","2019-08",0,""],[3,"For some strange reasons i can't access the older words which i had learnt from the beginner section of GRE. It kind of reset itself after a certain period. Is this some kind of bug?","2019-08",0,"bug,data,+exam"],[3,"Your app is good, but it lacks the dark mode. Many readers have eyesight problems, which makes it harder to look at the white screen for an hour.","2026-07",0,""],[3,"The application interface is minimalistic however, adequately effective. There are only 400-500 words all levels together. This is a very short list for GRE. Apart from the limited word count, I didn't find any other drawbacks of this app.","2019-07",0,"lack,ui,+effect,+short,+exam"],[4,"I have had the vocabulary builder app on every phone I've had for numerous years. It keeps me up-to-date on my vocabulary it's a brain builder, and it's fun! I love the fact that I know the meaning of these words. It's one thing to use what we call \"a 50 cent word\", it's another to actually know the meaning to where you use the word properly. Thank you developers vocabulary builder for educating and entertaining me for a lot of years","2024-09",0,"+fun"],[4,"Well this app is good enough but it has some flaws like 1. It should let see the bunch of word at first and learn them then the exam 2 . The words should have more examples 3 . It should also show the word in any language ,it will help non English speaking people . Overall good , simple, but it could be better😉","2022-08",0,"+short,+exam,+wish"],[5,"I have been using it and it works realy well for now, also offline without audio. I would realy recommend it if ur someone who doesn't like memorizing like a mad man, but it's like fun when u like open it, look at it, and close it, repeat for a few days, and u 'll remember the word. Finally good luck","2025-10",0,"+effect,+fun,+listen"],[5,"The tests are a great way to sharpen your thinking, and I like that the vocabulary words are relevant in day-to-day life for the most part. It's perfect that the app is simple, as I'm using an older phone, but it seems to hold up pretty well.","2026-08",0,"+short,+exam"],[5,"I love this app cus it helped me grow in my vocabulary. it has beginner, intermediate and advanced words for learners and the good thing is you won't be seeing any ads cus those things can be disturbing. I enjoy playing game with other learner ( player) to test if I'm improving","2026-04",0,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[5,"What is there not to like? It's free, and it's knowledgeable, useful, and the app ultimately helps vocabulary. If you don't believe me, repeat the same level 5 times when you forget to use a word you've learnt. It works! Good job!","2020-08",0,"+effect,+review,+free"],[5,"This is a fairly good game. It is to-the-point, offers good examples, clear definitions, and pronunciation guides too. It also reviews previous qs for learning reinforcement . I personally enjoyed and liked this game and would recommend it too.","2025-07",0,"+review,+fun,+listen,+exam"]];